$ govctl work new Test Task
Created work item: gov/work/<DATE>-test-task.toml
  ID: WI-<DATE>-001
exit: 0

$ govctl work edit WI-<DATE>-001 content.desc --set Legacy-prefixed description
error[E0803]: Unknown work item field: content.desc. Known fields: acceptance_criteria, completed, depends_on, description, notes, refs, started, status, tags, title, verification (WI-<DATE>-001)
exit: 1

$ govctl work get WI-<DATE>-001 description
Describe the work to be done.
What is the goal? What are the acceptance criteria?
exit: 0
